## Reviewer got wrong (not applied)
- a#2 treats the Q16–Q20 paragraph form as a Spanish outline bug. The Korean source
  and the English file use the same non-heading paragraphs. Spanish matches them.
- b#3 treats the missing "6" as a Spanish numbering bug. The Korean source and the
  English file skip from 5 to 7 as well.
- a#5 treats the extra "1" as redundant Spanish. The Korean source counts those
  digits ("1명", "1건"). Removing them is a number-parity failure, not a style choice.
- a#12 asks to replace the visible token `TWD 1.57M`. That token is pinned
  byte-identical. The Spanish amount is already in the parenthesis.
- a#11's suggested parentheses around Partner CPA cannot go in the lawyers
  description or the team description. Those strings are compared verbatim after
  the llms catalog strips parentheses. The comma fix was applied without them.
- a#7's diagnosis (the aside should not be a published correction) is right as
  prose and blocked by the digit 10. Not a misreading. Listed under skipped.

